WEBVTT

00:00.460 --> 00:04.460
Hello, my name is Ali Motahari
from meditranslate.com.

00:04.460 --> 00:10.460
While I was applying for Japanese government subsidies,
I was looking for someone I could fully trust—

00:10.460 --> 00:17.460
someone who could understand the process
and the Japanese system, and guide me through every step.

00:17.460 --> 00:26.460
Luckily, I came across TJ. He helped me translate
the documentation, do the research and market research,
and apply for the subsidies.

00:26.460 --> 00:34.460
Luckily, we got the result, which can potentially
transform our business in a positive way.

00:34.460 --> 00:43.460
If you are on the same path and exploring incentives,
I highly recommend TJ to help you through this process.

00:43.460 --> 00:44.460
Thank you.
